Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.47,0:00:20.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  乔伊  你好吗  很好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, Joey. How you doing? Great...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.89,0:00:22.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,室友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...roomie. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.98,0:00:26.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在的确是室友  没错  你这么一提醒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I guess we are roommates now. Yeah! Well, now that you brought it up...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.61,0:00:30.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个  我们的冰箱坏了  得买台新的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...uh, our fridge is broken. We have to get a new one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.48,0:00:34.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我打听过  你付一半400元   感激不尽\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, I checked around and your half is $400. Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.49,0:00:37.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不付呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not paying for half of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.66,0:00:40.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等我公寓修好了  我就搬回去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm only staying here until my apartment gets fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.49,0:00:45.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  这台冰箱是我出生之后  父母给买的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, Rach, my parents bought this fridge just after I was born. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.46,0:00:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我用一直都没问题   你一来它就坏了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, I have never had a problem with it. Then you show up and it breaks!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.67,0:00:52.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这说明什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What does that tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.30,0:00:57.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说明冰箱不能和人一样长寿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That refrigerators don't live as long as people?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.89,0:01:03.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  你也知道自动提款机一次只能提300元\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, now you know that the ATM only lets you take out 300 at a time...
