Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.45,0:02:04.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们有认识的帅哥吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, do You guys know any cute guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.45,0:02:07.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然有  就是我的好朋友乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, of course, I do. My good friend, Joey, over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.84,0:02:14.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我忘了  谢谢你  钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I'm sorry. Thank you, Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.63,0:02:19.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,周末有大型慈善晚会   罗夫罗兰买了一桌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anyway, there's this big charity ball this weekend and Ralph Lauren bought a table...
