Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.22,0:02:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么募捐啊   不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's the charity? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.51,0:02:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是某种树   就是某种病\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Something, either trees or disease,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.77,0:02:30.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗夫很会碎碎念\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ralph mumbles a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.90,0:02:34.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗夫都趁你不专心时碎碎念吗   对呀   好奇怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Does Ralph mumble when you're not paying attention? Yeah. It's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.36,0:02:37.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总之  我得找个男伴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But the thing is, I need to find a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.74,0:02:39.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想找什么样的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, What kind of guy are you looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.57,0:02:43.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自己有晚礼服或租得起晚礼服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, Someone that has his own tux or has the ability to rent a tux.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.66,0:02:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,必须是男人  身家起码要有50元\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So he has to be a male who has at least $50.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.54,0:02:48.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢  只差一点点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ooh, so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.12,0:02:51.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大家好   嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, everybody. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.00,0:02:54.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是伊丽莎白  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, this is Elizabeth. Hi, Elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.13,0:02:57.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是那个学生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm the student. Ha-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.51,0:02:59.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真可爱啊  才怪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Isn't she cute?  No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.64,0:03:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我不该多嘴   但你们不是不想在公共场所\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know, this is probably none of my business, but weren't you guys supposed...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.89,0:03:08.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被别人看到在一起吗   我们没有在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...to not be seen in public together? Oh, we're not together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.18,0:03:11.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  我们只是  在咖啡馆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. We're just two people who happen to have run into each other...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.44,0:03:13.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,巧遇的两个人而已\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...here at the coffee house. Heh, this is--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.65,0:03:17.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢  真狡猾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, sly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.99,0:03:21.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真想好好认识你们   不过我该走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I really wanted to meet you guys, but I have to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.53,0:03:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,改天见  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll see you later? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.37,0:03:24.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  再见  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bye, Ross. Bye. See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.91,0:03:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是故意撞到你的  先生  没关系  女士\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oops! I did not mean to run into you like that, sir. That is quite all right, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.71,0:03:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.67,0:03:35.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她干吗走了   要上晚自习还要去赶作业\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So why's she leaving? Is it a school night and she has a lot of homework to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.96,0:03:39.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  她明天要交分子流行病学报告\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes. Her molecular epidemiology paper is due tomorrow.
