Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.60,0:03:49.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她什么时候生日   我不知道   瑞秋  干吗问呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh! When's her birthday? I don't know, Rachel. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.98,0:03:53.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我好久没吃儿童生日餐了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you know it's just been so long since I've been to Chuck E. Cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.56,0:03:57.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢伊丽莎白  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I like Elizabeth. Well, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.11,0:04:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很喜欢她   叫她今年早点送曲奇饼干来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In fact, I like her so much that you tell her I want my cookies early this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.70,0:04:06.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要薄荷巧克力饼和巧克力派\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know, A box of Thin Mints and some Tag-a-longs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.20,0:04:10.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们别整他了  说真的  你们交往得怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey-hey come on you guys, give him a break. Ross, seriously, how's it going with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:12.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, actually it's been great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.16,0:04:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她才20岁   还不想太认真\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's 20, so she's not looking for anything too serious...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.00,0:04:17.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最适合现在的我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...which is perfect for me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.42,0:04:20.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  她真的好像很不错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, that is great. And seriously, she seems very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.59,0:04:22.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢   我知道你们喜欢涮我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thanks. I know you guys like to give me a hard time and all,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.97,0:04:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我真的希望你们能喜欢她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but it really means a lot to me that you like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.26,0:04:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要知道你们  我想到一个很棒的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just knowing that you guys are, like. Okay, I got a good one.
