Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.36,0:04:46.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德   你觉得我们的沟通够吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler, do you think we talk about our relationship enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.32,0:04:49.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,够了  有水果卷吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Do we have any Fruit Roll Ups?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.54,0:04:51.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.79,0:04:55.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我刚想到一个人  很适合当瑞秋的男伴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I just thought of the perfect guy for Rachel to take to her thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.75,0:04:57.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有意思  我们也找到人了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh that's so funny, we found someone too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.88,0:05:02.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那好  她可以在我的人和你们的怪胎之中选一个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh that's good. I guess she'll have a choice between my guy and your weirdo.
