Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.87,0:05:37.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我这个身材很赞   他是我的按摩客人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, my guy is spectacular, okay? He's a massage client.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.13,0:05:43.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一次他在按摩台上  就被我看个精光光的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And one time, um, when he was on the table, I looked at it. And I mean, all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.34,0:05:47.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是不能偷看吗   报警啊   来抓我啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're not supposed to look. Yeah, like there are police for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.09,0:05:52.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你也给我按摩过  你会偷看  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait! you look? You massaged me. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.52,0:05:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  你那个或许有好身材  但我们这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, your guy may have a great body, but our guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.77,0:06:00.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相当幽默   钱德式的幽默\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}is really funny. Chandler funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.90,0:06:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们这个舞功高强   我这个饱读诗书\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Our guy's a great dancer. My guy's well-read.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.49,0:06:06.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们这个一头靓发   我这个两排洁牙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Our guy has great hair. My guy has great teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.90,0:06:09.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们这个香的不得了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Our guys smells incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.57,0:06:12.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们说的是一个人吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you want our guy to be your guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.66,0:06:16.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.17,0:06:25.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的脸色不太好   乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you don't look good, Joe.
