Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.19,0:06:42.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么  你准备付我多少钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ahem, so, anyway, how do you want to pay me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.44,0:06:46.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要提供某种服务吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is this a service you're providing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.07,0:06:52.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  是我要买新冰箱   我们的新冰箱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, for my new fridge. For our new fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.20,0:06:53.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的新冰箱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Our new fridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.66,0:06:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都不在这里住了   那又怎样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't live here anymore. So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.37,0:06:59.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,假设我们是离婚的夫妻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, okay, suppose we were a, uh, divorced couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.42,0:07:02.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我取得了孩子的监护权\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh-huh. And I got custody of the kid. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.79,0:07:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果孩子死了  我总得买个新孩子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, suppose the kid dies and I gotta buy a new kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.22,0:07:11.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.97,0:07:15.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我400元\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Give me $400!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.31,0:07:23.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,盖勒教授\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Professor Geller? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.40,0:07:25.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔   一名我不认识的学生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, a student I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.94,0:07:30.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想问下   能不能跟您谈一会儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was wondering if I could talk to you for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.49,0:07:33.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然可以  是哪方面的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, of course. What would this be regarding?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.32,0:07:35.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在你的研究室亲热一下  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Making out in your office. Wh-Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.08,0:07:39.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  我们进去谈如何\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, of course. Why don't we go inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.71,0:07:48.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢  哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mm-Oh, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.71,0:07:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  门把手   门把手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Doorknob. Doorknob.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.80,0:07:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sorry. Ha-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.39,0:07:56.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的有事要讲   好  什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, I actually do need to talk to you. Oh. Okay, what about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.85,0:07:59.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,春游   春游\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Spring vacation. Spring vacation?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.48,0:08:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对   学校没课  很多人要出去旅行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, we have time off, and a lot of people are going on trips--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.85,0:08:07.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,盖勒教授  是  菲森死盯个乐教授\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Professor Geller. Yes, Professor Fiesenstinlender?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.11,0:08:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等我一分钟  我马上就好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll be with you in one moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.32,0:08:14.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我就买一盒薄荷巧克力饼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I will take one box of the Thin Mints.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.66,0:08:23.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们不懂   伊丽莎白想找我跟她去旅行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't understand. Elizabeth was about to ask me to go on a trip with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.75,0:08:26.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这样叫慢慢来吗   我还没准备好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is that taking it slow? I'm not ready for this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.75,0:08:30.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我该怎么说   实话实说  说你还没准备好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do I tell her? Tell her the truth. You're not ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.47,0:08:33.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以试试\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I could do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.97,0:08:37.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是她不高兴呢   你就拿芭比娃娃逗她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, what if she gets upset? Then you distract her with a Barbie doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.47,0:08:41.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或者\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.81,0:08:44.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也可以  你知道的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you could just, you know, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.11,0:08:50.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这是在干什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.15,0:08:52.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.82,0:08:56.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我干什么  你刚弄坏了我的冰箱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What the hell am I doing? You just broke my fridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.28,0:09:01.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你怎么知道它坏了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? How do you know if-How do you know it's even broken?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.95,0:09:04.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它怎么坏的我会不知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, you think I don't know what breaks my fridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.08,0:09:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.54,0:09:12.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看嘛   坏了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, what do you know? Broken!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.76,0:09:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要赔400元\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That'll be $400.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.51,0:09:17.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  我看见你推他了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, I saw you push him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.31,0:09:22.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你推的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You pushed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.31,0:09:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  我没把它弄坏  它早就坏了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, I did not break this. Okay? That has been broken for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.98,0:09:34.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德   记不记得我提过这是我们的冰箱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Chandler, do you remember how I told you about our fridge? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.70,0:09:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我到现在还没收到你那一半钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I still haven't gotten the check for your half yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.70,0:09:40.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要给他钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do not give him any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.33,0:09:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你少插嘴   弄坏冰箱的家伙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not talking to you! You broke my fridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.88,0:09:56.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,盖勒教授   你找我  是的  请进\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You wanted to see me, Professor Geller? Yes. Yes. Please come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.80,0:10:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢  哦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mm, ooh, ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.18,0:10:04.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,门把手  对  有点玩上瘾了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Doorknob? Yeah. It kind of grows on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.73,0:10:08.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  我想和你谈谈春游的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually, I wanted to finish talking to you about spring vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.94,0:10:10.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔   好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.40,0:10:14.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, L...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.32,0:10:20.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你在一起很开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I've been having a great time with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.12,0:10:26.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想进展得太快   那样会给大家压力\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I just don't want us to move too fast or put too much pressure on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.08,0:10:30.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以很抱歉   我们还不能一起出去旅行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I'm sorry, I just don't think we should go away together yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.29,0:10:31.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那样太快了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.63,0:10:35.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你误会我的意思了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, Ross, I think you misunderstood what I was saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.88,0:10:40.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想告诉你   我要去佛罗里达州两星期\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just wanted to tell you that I'm going to Florida for a couple weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.26,0:10:45.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.64,0:10:50.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你误会我的意思了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think you misunderstood what I was saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.15,0:10:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是  你真的好可爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What I meant was... You are so adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.15,0:10:57.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个  我们来谈谈可爱吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That. Let's talk about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.66,0:11:01.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.16,0:11:04.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和伊丽莎白谈得怎么样了  喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How did it go with Elizabeth? Huh? Oh, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.37,0:11:08.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事  只是一场误会  她不是要我一起去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}it was fine. It was just a misunderstanding. She didn't want me to go with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.33,0:11:12.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她只是要告诉我   她准备去佛州春游\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She just wanted to let me know that she's going to Florida for spring vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.21,0:11:15.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等   她是去春游  还是去度春假\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait, is she going for spring vacation or going for spring break.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.59,0:11:19.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么差别吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's the difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.01,0:11:23.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,春游就是跟爷爷奶奶一起共享天伦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A spring vacation, you're doing nice things with your grandparents.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.39,0:11:26.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,春假嘛   就是跟兄弟会的人上床\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Spring break, you're doing frat guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.52,0:11:30.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是每个人的春假都那样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you know what? Not all spring breaks are like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.02,0:11:33.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你是怎么过的   我跟我爸去了埃及\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What did you do on yours? I went to Egypt with my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.86,0:11:38.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能想像   "看  爸爸  狮身人面像"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can see it now. "Look, Dad, it's the Sphinx."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.20,0:11:44.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想伊丽莎白那么正经   不会去"春假"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think Elizabeth is a little more serious than, "Spring break!"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.79,0:11:48.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吗   她修了我的课\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right? Come on, she's taking my class.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.04,0:11:52.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还跟教授上床   我给她打电话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And slept with the professor. I'm gonna call her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.84,0:11:58.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位  这是塞巴斯蒂\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you guys, I want you to meet Sebastian.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.05,0:12:00.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚刚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. We just, uh--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.47,0:12:05.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在报摊认识   我们同时抓起了一本《原野与河流》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We just met at the newsstand. We both grabbed for the last Field and Stream. Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.10,0:12:07.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呃   我读过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What, I read that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.97,0:12:11.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去给你拿杯咖啡   好啊   谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can I get you a cup of coffee? Oh, yes. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.23,0:12:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  你这是什么意思  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel, what the hell is this? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.57,0:12:22.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你叫我们帮你找男伴   却自己带了个人来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You ask us to find you a guy, and then you come in here with a guy of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.86,0:12:24.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们帮我找到人了  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You found me a guy? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.41,0:12:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在钱德的公司  看中了一个可爱风趣的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We found you a really cute, funny guy from Chandler's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.91,0:12:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也找了一个   至少不是怪人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, and I found you one, too, who is not a weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.75,0:12:35.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很感激你们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what though, guys, I really appreciate that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.67,0:12:38.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我还是带塞巴斯蒂一起去舞会好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but I'm just gonna take Sebastian to the charity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.42,0:12:41.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定   我们的这个浑身异香\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you sure? Because our guy smells incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.30,0:12:44.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别再提那个了好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Would you stop it with that already?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.47,0:12:47.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的咖啡   谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here you go. Sure. Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.18,0:12:51.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,塞巴斯蒂   你是义工吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, Sebastian, do you do any volunteer work?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.43,0:12:53.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  怎么了  没事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, no, not really. Why? No reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.81,0:12:57.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是我认识一个   关心别人的单身好男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just I know a single guy who does care about other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.61,0:13:00.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你风趣吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.32,0:13:03.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  你们这是在干吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excuse me? What are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.11,0:13:06.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你风趣吗   讲个笑话来听听\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you funny? Tell us a joke!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.87,0:13:10.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想和瑞秋喝杯咖啡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I just wanted to have coffee with Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.29,0:13:11.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊   很多人都想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, so do a lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.04,0:13:16.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说实话   我想我该走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually, uh, I gotta get going. Oh, but you--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.75,0:13:20.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有空打电话   不过你没给我电话号码\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Give me a call sometime. But you didn't give me your number.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.30,0:13:21.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那好  改天见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.55,0:13:25.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来他蛮风趣的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Turns out he is kind of funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.64,0:13:32.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我简直不能相信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I cannot believe you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.06,0:13:36.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他这么好   就这样被你们赶走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He was really nice and he just left because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.23,0:13:39.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"塞巴斯蒂"   听起来像猫的名字\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, but, "Sebastian"? What is that, a cat's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.69,0:13:43.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我发现了什么   瑞秋  他很胆小\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what I noticed, Rachel, he scares easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.86,0:13:46.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你难道带这样的人去舞会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, is that the kind of guy you want to take to a ball?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.74,0:13:48.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"塞巴斯蒂   要不要跳舞"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Sebastian, would you like to dance?"
