Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.98,0:20:01.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有时候买的是30   里面只能达到4   我发誓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, sometimes you get 30, sometimes it's 4, and I swear...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.45,0:20:03.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有很多  都只是牛奶而已\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...more often than not, it's just milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.82,0:20:07.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你放心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, it's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.70,0:20:10.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是要去跟一堆男生鬼混\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not going down there to hook up with a bunch of guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.08,0:20:14.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很喜欢你  我珍惜我们的关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I really like you. I like how things are going between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.88,0:20:16.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  对啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.54,0:20:19.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是跟朋友们出去放松玩玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm just going down there to relax and hang outwith my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.55,0:20:23.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  酷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Cool. Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.30,0:20:25.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  他们来了  嘿  伊丽莎白\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, here they are. Hey, Elizabeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.81,0:20:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.27,0:20:38.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,打电话给我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Call me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.61,0:20:47.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋   抱歉把那些人硬塞给你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel, we're sorry for pushing those guys on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.41,0:20:50.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系   我玩得很开心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's all right. I ended up having a really good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.29,0:20:54.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,晚会很成功  募到了很多款  而且受到了关注\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know, the charity was a big success, they raised a lot of money and awareness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.92,0:20:57.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到底  为什么募款\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So, what was it for, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.29,0:21:00.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好像是一种疾病吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wanna say a disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.72,0:21:03.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿   嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.09,0:21:08.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯留了条奇怪的信息   叫我们看MTV台\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just got this weird message from Ross. He said turn on MTV. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.43,0:21:16.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看  天啊  是伊丽莎白\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, look! That's Elizabeth! Ha-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.70,0:21:28.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  盖勒教授\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, oh, Professor Geller.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.58,0:21:33.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊哈   重温13岁旧梦   是啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah, to be 13 again. Yeah.
